msgid "Served by GNOME Remote Desktop VNC (port 5900); exposure follows GNOME Settings > Sharing"
msgstr "Shërbehet nga GNOME Remote Desktop VNC (porta 5900); ekspozimi ndjek Rregullimet GNOME > Ndarje"

